  "fullDescription": "Meet your new favorite collection of irresistibly sweet designs! The Kawaii Cute Pastel Fruit Clipart Bundle is a delightful set of 40 illustrations that bring charm, color, and personality to any project. Featuring a variety of adorable fruits in soft pastel tones, each clipart is designed in a playful kawaii style with expressive faces and gentle details that instantly brighten your creations.\n\nPerfect for digital planners, stickers, invitations, social media graphics, scrapbooking, and more, this bundle offers a versatile mix of fruits, from smiling strawberries and blushing peaches to cheerful bananas and tiny citrus friends. The soft color palette makes it ideal for aesthetic, minimal, and kid-friendly designs, while the high-quality files ensure easy use across both print and digital formats.\n\nWhether you’re a designer, small business owner, or creative hobbyist, this collection is made to inspire joy and add a touch of sweetness to everything you create\n\nPerfect for:\n– wall art\n– stickers\n– bags\n– book covers\n– gift wrapping\n– invitations\n– scrapbook\n– decorations\n– stationaries\n– greeting cards\n– sublimation\n– packaging and more\n\nWHAT IS INCLUDED:\n————————————————-\n⦁ 40 unique spring clipart\n⦁ 300 dpi high resolution\n⦁ 5000 x 5000 pixels\n⦁ SVG, EPS, PNG (with transparent background) formats",
